  The caption's 'நடவடிக்கை' (action) line adds 'தாம்பரம் மாநகர காவல் ஆணையரகம் மற்றும் பள்ளிக்கரணை காவல் மாவட்டத்தில் சோதனை' — the article says the search covered areas within these jurisdictions, which is acceptable, but the reel_script says 'பள்ளிக்கரணை காவல் மாவட்ட எல்லைக்குட்பட்ட பகுதிகளில்' while the caption's 'ஈஸ்வரன் தலைமையில்... சோதனை' links the commissionerate and district together; no clear factual error here.
  The reel_script states the 3 women and 5 people were arrested 'for possessing banned tablets' in the apartment context, merging the arrest with the Kannagi Nagar tablet seizure without the article specifying that the arrested people were linked to that seizure; the article says the 5 were arrested for holding banned tablets, which is accurate, but the sentence about the apartment building search is placed as a separate fact without stating the arrests came from it, mixing two facts.
  The caption says '5 பேர் கைதாகினர்' and the caption adds the posting date 'நவம்பர் 19, 2026' is fine (exempt), but the caption states the searches were 'அதிகாலை முதல்' which matches the article.
  The reel_script omits the article's fact that a woman was crying while being put into the police vehicle and family members wept on the second woman's arrest; this is an emotional detail, not essential, so it is not a required omission.
